# EngineerPDFAI

Streamlit app for construction price adjustment (IPC/PPPA).

## Features
- 📂 Upload CSV/Excel indices
- 🧮 Calculate IPC adjustments
- 📈 Interactive Plotly charts
- 🔮 Forecast payments with Prophet
- 📄 Export reports (CSV, JSON, PDF)

## Installation
```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
streamlit run app.py
